WEBVTT

01:01:29.208 --> 01:01:32.184
which is an unwritten set
of expectations and obligations

01:01:32.208 --> 01:01:33.851
that you have with your employer.

01:01:33.875 --> 01:01:36.351
There are basically
three types that we've studied.

01:01:36.375 --> 01:01:38.768
There's an economic contract,
which is basically,

01:01:38.792 --> 01:01:42.976
"Look, I'll do my job and you pay me
to support myself and my family."

01:01:43.000 --> 01:01:45.620
There's a relational contract,
which is much more about,

01:01:45.644 --> 01:01:51.809
"OK, I will invest in this organization
as a community or a family,

01:01:51.833 --> 01:01:54.768
and I'll bring a little bit
of extra dedication and commitment

01:01:54.792 --> 01:01:56.184
to the people in the place.

01:01:56.208 --> 01:01:59.726
And in return, what I expect is to be
treated like a member of the family."

01:01:59.750 --> 01:02:03.476
And then the final type of contract
is more of a cause,